      "docstring": "spring mvc 响应参数接口标记注解,被标记的接口将会脱敏响应参数\n <pre>\n     {@code\n     class Sample{\n         @FuzzyValue(beginAt=1,endAt=2)\n         private String name=\"1234\";\n     }\n\n     @FuzzyResult\n     @GetMapping(\"/getOne\")\n     public Sample getOne(){\n         return new Sample();\n         //response= {name: \"1**4\"}\n     }\n\n     }\n </pre>\n\n @author chiyo\n @since 1.0.2",
      "supertypes": [],
      "typeParameters": [],
      "permits": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "function",
      "name": "field",
      "qualifiedName": "com.fairychar.bag.beans.spring.mvc.FuzzyResult.field",
      "ownerQualifiedName": "com.fairychar.bag.beans.spring.mvc.FuzzyResult",
      "signature": "String field() default \"\"",
      "visibility": "public",
      "visibilityExplicit": false,
      "range": {
        "start": {
          "line": 50,
          "column": 5
        },
        "end": {
          "line": 50,
          "column": 31
        }
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "modifiers": [],
      "docstring": "由于接口大多会包装一层进行返回,如\n <pre>\n {@code\n public HttpResult<User> getUser();\n }\n </pre>\n 这种情况下,实际业务返回对象为User.class,但是HttpResult一般无法在data字段上添加注解\n 提供field属性,取包装体字段为模糊对象进行模糊处理\n 属性字段名称,如果有值则会取对应字段值为Object,可以通过.分割\n 如果值为空则取当前返回对象为Object\n <pre>{@code\n @FuzzyResult(field = \"data.user\")\n }\n </pre>\n\n @return {@link String}",
      "typeParameters": [],
      "returnType": "String",
      "throws": [],
      "defaultExpression": "\"\"",
      "parameters": []
    }
  ],
